<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>كرتون بالعربي</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#050505;
color:white;
overflow:hidden;
}

/* Loading Screen */

#loader{
position:fixed;
width:100%;
height:100%;
background:#000;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
flex-direction:column;
z-index:9999;
}

.spinner{
width:90px;
height:90px;
border:7px solid #222;
border-top:7px solid cyan;
border-radius:50%;
animation:spin 1s linear infinite;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

@keyframes spin{
100%{
transform:rotate(360deg);
}
}

#loader h2{
font-size:30px;
color:white;
letter-spacing:2px;
}

/* Main */

#main{
display:none;
padding:40px;
min-height:100vh;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#050505,#101010);
}

header{
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:50px;
}

header h1{
font-size:45px;
color:cyan;
text-shadow:0 0 20px cyan;
}

header p{
color:#aaa;
margin-top:10px;
font-size:18px;
}

.cards{

display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:35px;

}

.card{

background:#111;
border-radius:18px;
overflow:hidden;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.35s;
border:2px solid #222;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,255,255,.15);

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.03);

border-color:cyan;

box-shadow:0 0 35px cyan;

}

.card img{

width:100%;
height:360px;
object-fit:cover;

}

.card h2{

padding:20px;
text-align:center;
font-size:28px;

}

footer{

text-align:center;
margin-top:60px;
color:#666;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div id="loader">

<div class="spinner"></div>

<h2>Loading...</h2>

</div>

<div id="main">

<header>

<h1>🎬 كرتون بالعربي</h1>

<p>اختر الكرتون الذي تريد مشاهدته</p>

</header>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card" onclick="location.href='gumball.html'">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?w=800" alt="">

<h2>عالم غامبول المدهش</h2>

</div>

<div class="card" onclick="location.href='clarence.html'">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526374965328-7f61d4dc18c5?w=800" alt="">

<h2>كلارنس</h2>

</div>

<div class="card" onclick="location.href='regularshow.html'">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?w=800" alt="">

<h2>العرض العادي</h2>

</div>

</div>

<footer>

<p>© Cartoon Arabic</p>

</footer>

</div>

<script>

setTimeout(function(){

document.getElementById("loader").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("main").style.display="block";

document.body.style.overflow="auto";

},2500);

</script>

</body>
</html>
